  "fullDescription": "Add a peaceful and elegant glow to your holiday decor with this Elegant Christmas Angel Candle Holder 3D STL. Featuring a graceful faceless angel with flowing robes, a star detail, and a beautifully integrated candle bowl held in both hands, this sculptural design creates a warm centerpiece for Christmas and faith-inspired spaces.\n\nPerfect For:\nChristmas home decor\nAngel candle displays\nHoliday centerpieces\nChristmas table decor\nMantel and shelf decor\nReligious home decor\nPrayer room decor\nChurch Christmas displays\nWinter decorations\nMeaningful Christmas gifts\nColor Customization:\n\nThe models can be colored using software such as Bambu Studio, PrusaSlicer, Cura, or other compatible slicer software, allowing you to customize the bodies, hats, pom-poms, beaks, eyes, polka dots, textured sections, and other details with your preferred colors.\n\nNote:\n\nNote: This is a digital STL file set, not a physical product. A compatible 3D printer is required to create the physical models.",
